  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reintegration through Integrated support and Empowerment: (RISE)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The RISE is a joint project between UNDP and UNICEF. The overall objective is to address the reintegration needs of vulnerable children, young persons, adults, and other stigmatized groups such as families with perceived ISIL-affiliation returning to Iraq from NES, as well as of conflict-affected host community members. The UNDP-related components will support the facilitation of the return of displaced person to Iraq, including ISIL-perceived families through dialogues and social cohesion inter</narrative>
  </description>
